c\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-6/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-06.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Pool with travertine coping beside a covered patio and palm trees, renovated pool in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-6/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-06.jpg\" alt=\"Pool with travertine coping beside a covered patio and palm trees, renovated pool in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-5/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-05.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Pool with a raised spa wall, glass-tile waterline and a shaded travertine deck, pool remodeling in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-5/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-05.jpg\" alt=\"Pool with a raised spa wall, glass-tile waterline and a shaded travertine deck, pool remodeling in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><div class=\"mm-mosaico-resto\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-4/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-04.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Long lap pool with a raised spa and a wide paver deck beside an open lawn, new pool construction in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-4/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-04.jpg\" alt=\"Long lap pool with a raised spa and a wide paver deck beside an open lawn, new pool construction in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-3/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-03.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Pool with a sun shelf, two loungers and a raised white spa spilling into the water, pool remodeling in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-3/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-03.jpg\" alt=\"Pool with a sun shelf, two loungers and a raised white spa spilling into the water, pool remodeling in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-2/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-02.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Aerial view of a pool with a mosaic spa, palms and a covered terrace, completed pool renovation in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-2/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-02.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a pool with a mosaic spa, palms and a covered terrace, completed pool renovation in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"946\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-1/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-01.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Rectangular pool with a raised mosaic spa, basketball hoop and travertine deck, pool remodeling in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-1/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-01.jpg\" alt=\"Rectangular pool with a raised mosaic spa, basketball hoop and travertine deck, pool remodeling in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Pool Renovation <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our licensed pool contractors manage inspection, demolition, installation, and finishing for renovations that meet Florida safety codes throughout.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Request a Design-Build Project Evaluation</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-proc-medio\" data-mm-pasos-medio=\"\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-064/pool-remodeling-assessment-old-spa-inspection.avif\" alt=\"Technician inspecting an old tiled spa with a broken brick coping before a pool remodel in Florida\" width=\"1800\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"01 / 04\" data-t=\"Pool Assessment &amp; Condition Analysis\"></div></figure><ol class=\"mm-pasos\" data-mm-pasos=\"\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-064/pool-remodeling-assessment-old-spa-inspection.avif\" alt=\"Technician inspecting an old tiled spa with a broken brick coping before a pool remodel in Florida\" width=\"1800\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Pool Assessment &amp; Condition Analysis</h3><p>Detailed inspection identifying plaster delamination, structural cracks, equipment aging, circulation inefficiencies, and aesthetic improvements needed. We use underwater camera inspection to assess interior conditions and plan targeted renovations.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-053/pool-renovation-travertine-deck-cobalt-tile-spa.avif\" alt=\"French-pattern travertine deck and cobalt tile around a raised spa, materials for a pool renovation in Florida\" width=\"1800\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Renovation Design &amp; Material Selection</h3><p>Design consultation for modernization including updated finishes, enhanced circulation systems, lighting upgrades, and deck resurfacing options. We present 3D renderings showing before/after transformations.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-crew-at-work-on-drained-pool.avif\" alt=\"Crew cutting block and setting the deck around a drained pool during a pool remodeling project in Florida\" width=\"1260\" height=\"840\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:15% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Permits &amp; Project Coordination</h3><p>Acquisition of renovation permits and coordinated scheduling with utility providers. For major renovations, Notice of Commencement filing and ARB re-approval may be required.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-064/pool-renovation-new-white-plaster-hand-troweled.avif\" alt=\"Two workers hand-troweling new white plaster in a drained pool with blue waterline tile, pool renovation in Florida\" width=\"1200\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:35% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Renovation Execution &amp; System Upgrades</h3><p>Full renovation including surface restoration, equipment replacement, circulation upgrades, and integration of smart automation systems for enhanced functionality and energy efficiency.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"mm-que\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Pool Remodeling &amp; Full Renovation Services in Florida</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We remodel and renovate pools across North &amp; South Florida, upgrading finishes, equipment, and features for safety and efficiency.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Request a Design-Build Project Evaluation</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo mm-grupo--activo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Shell &amp; Structural Restoration</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">A complete renovation starts below the surface. We assess the shell, plumbing and safety barrier first; where the structure needs it, the remodel rebuilds the gunite and brings plumbing and barriers up to current Florida Building Code. Every finish and fixture we install rides on that structure.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Complete Pool Renovation</dt><dd>Full pool renovations designed to modernize appearance, improve functionality, and extend the life of your pool.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Structural Pool Repairs</dt><dd>Shell and structural work carried out as part of a complete renovation, when the assessment calls for it.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Resurfacing, Tile &amp; Coping</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We strip the old interior down to sound gunite and apply plaster, quartz, or pebble finishes rated for Florida sun and salt systems. We replace waterline tile and coping in the same pass, sealing the bond beam and leaving an edge that stays cool underfoot.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pool Resurfacing &amp; Finishes</dt><dd>Pool resurfacing solutions including plaster, quartz, and pebble finishes for durability and style.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Tile &amp; Coping Replacement</dt><dd>Tile and coping upgrades that enhance pool safety, aesthetics, and long-term structural protection.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Equipment, Automation &amp; LED Lighting</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Salt air and year-round run times are hard on pool equipment, so a complete remodel is the moment to replace it as one system: variable-speed pumps, filters, heaters and salt cells sized to the renovated pool, and low-voltage LED in place of incandescent fixtures. New wiring lands on GFCI-protected circuits bonded to the deck grid, as code requires.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pool Equipment Upgrades</dt><dd>Pumps, filtration, heaters and automation replaced as one system within a complete remodel.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>LED Pool Lighting Systems</dt><dd>Energy-efficient LED pool lighting designed to enhance visibility, ambiance, and nighttime safety.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Pool Decks &amp; Spa Integration</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">A renovated pool beside a cracked, slick deck still looks tired. We resurface decks with textured, UV-stable coatings or pavers that stay walkable in South Florida heat, and we tie a new or remodeled spa into the pool so both share one plumbing and heating system.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pool Deck Resurfacing</dt><dd>Pool deck resurfacing services that improve safety, appearance, and outdoor functionality.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Spa Remodeling &amp; Integration</dt><dd>Spa remodeling and integration services that complement pool renovations for added comfort.</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos mm-datos--tel\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-que-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-064/pool-shell-repair-spa-bond-beam-rebuild.avif\" alt=\"Spa with a newly poured concrete bond beam and exposed plumbing beside a drained pool, structural pool repair in Florida\" width=\"1200\" height=\"670\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"01 / 04\" data-t=\"Shell &amp; Structural Restoration\"></div></figure></div></section><section class=\"mm-ad\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">From Worn-Out Pool to a Resort-Style <span class=\"mm-rot\">Renovation</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Breathe new life into your aging South Florida pool. Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living handles full pool remodels — new plaster finishes, tile, coping, and equipment upgrades — transforming your dated pool into a refined backyard showpiece.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"/request-estimated\">Get a Free Estimate</a><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/projects\">View All Projects<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-ad-par\"><figure class=\"mm-ad-foto\"><img src=\"/images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-1280.avif\" srcset=\"/images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-640.avif 640w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-960.avif 960w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-1280.avif 1280w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-1600.avif 1600w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-1920.avif 1920w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Before: screened pool with a painted concrete deck, brick coping and dark tile, ahead of a pool remodel in Florida\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"mm-ad-etq mm-ad-etq--antes\">Before</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"mm-ad-foto\"><img src=\"/images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-1280.avif\" srcset=\"/images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-640.avif 640w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-960.avif 960w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-1280.avif 1280w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-1600.avif 1600w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-1920.avif 1920w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" alt=\"After: the same pool with blue glass waterline tile and an ivory travertine deck, pool renovation in Florida\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"mm-ad-etq mm-ad-etq--despues\">After</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"mm-ad-datos\"><div><h3 class=\"mm-dato-rot\">Design-Build Authority</h3><p>One team handles design, permits, engineering, and construction. No subcontractor surprises, no gaps in accountability.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"mm-dato-rot\">Licensed &amp; Engineered</h3><p>Florida licensed and insured professionals. Every project is built to code, built to last, and built to impress.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-cat\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Project <span class=\"mm-rot\">Gallery</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">See pools, pergolas and outdoor kitchens we have built for Florida homeowners.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Request a Design-Build Project Evaluation</a></div></div></div><ul class=\"mm-cat-fila\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"mm-cat-tesela\"><span class=\"mm-cat-foto\"><img src=\"/images/obra/teselas/gallery-tile-pools-and-spas-480.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"(min-wi